        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Perfect place for haircut.\nAjay perfectly cut design which I showed him in very easy manner.\nHe is very  polite and humble.\nI will recommend every one to visit his shop for haircut.",
