      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tayyab shahzad",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107690496072737489392/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYoOZ8fPMzoDY1omtp8mi8dd4cZogFY2XuRdMF8u6Gm2hZ9LMMgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "The best barbershop in the area! I got the best haircut and the best service. Recommended. I got keratin treatment and had the best results",
        "time": 1701837439,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "shah naseeb",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113278678101555694411/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUFxzg_CFrQvzw6MCEXnQOiJntm2kYnB3HcLsPrvJ-00BYizkMG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Had an amazing experience getting my haircut and beard trim from Subhan Trimzz. I had long hair before and got them short from Mr. Rauf who is a magician when it comes to hair transformation. Everyone loved the change and appreciated the new look. I will highly recommend them and would definitely visit again for their services.",
        "time": 1710551190,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Muhammad Hafeez",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113292841843384123376/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI_0pbBOYTuMrMe38RyJSVbLKLfGJ4qKcnTLaKbxtSMvPnOMw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I went to this place for the first time and the service I got was fantastic and flawless. Shoutout to Saba, he did a great job and he took his time, paying attention to detail. Truly haven’t had a cut this good in a while.. The shop was very cleaned and well organized. Would definitely get another cut here!",
        "time": 1704472871,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shahbaz Chaudry",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115125981149856079157/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVARSkGzmqZiZJ1aVqeOBKiNZytXH8gGPF3gV4fANSXTIIN-0w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
